<title>SWEDEN: Incentive says U.S. authorities approve Vivra buy.</title>
<headline>Incentive says U.S. authorities approve Vivra buy.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish investment company Incentive said on Tuesday U.S. competition authorities approved its purchase of U.S. dialysis clinics group Vivra for $35.62 a share.  </p>
<p>The offering period will run to June 6, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Birgitta Forsberg, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
